{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Enact a 2-6% wealth tax on all assets over \u00a310 million",
        "additional_details": "We believe a wealth tax could be a step towards closing the wealth gap and preventing any return to feudalism. The income generated could be used to support lower income families or to provide the Government with more money to increase public funding, or possibly a mix",
        "background": "We call on the Government to enact a wealth tax between 2-6% (or higher depending on the individual\u2019s net worth) on all assets that are over \u00a310 million, with no exemptions or losses.",
